<view wx:if="{{open}}" class="mask"><view class="dialog"><text class="heading">隐私授权</text><text>保存壁纸需要向系统相册写入图片；选择照片时需要读取你选中的图片。请阅读隐私保护指引后选择是否同意。</text><button class="contract" bindtap="contract">{{contractName}}</button><text wx:if="{{contractError}}">{{contractError}}</text><button id="agree-privacy" class="agree" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="agree">同意并继续</button><button class="reject" bindtap="reject">暂不同意</button></view></view>
